The models were converted to int8 ONNX for in browser inference; the weights
are otherwise unmodified. This product also vendors the transformers.js web
bundle (@huggingface/transformers, Apache 2.0) and the ONNX Runtime Web wasm
binaries (MIT) under frontend/public/vendor/.

Knowledge artifacts are built from public primary sources: CDC/NCHS ICD-10-CM
FY2026 release, CMS Physician Fee Schedule and Clinical Laboratory Fee
Schedule 2026, CMS hospital outpatient department prior authorization list,
CMS Unplanned Hospital Visits national data (data.cms.gov), AHRQ HCUP CCSR
v2025-1, NLM RxNorm prescribable content, and MedlinePlus Connect. CPT
descriptors are copyright of the American Medical Association and are not
distributed with this product.
